Big Bro, there's fireworks!

00:19:35.408 --> 00:19:37.842
Yeah, there sure are.

00:19:40.380 --> 00:19:41.779
They're pretty...

00:19:43.049 --> 00:19:45.882
Yeah. They are pretty.

00:19:50.356 --> 00:19:51.755
Mister!

00:20:49.682 --> 00:20:53.880
Bringing a smile to their faces is really amazing!

00:20:55.121 --> 00:20:56.053
Yep!

00:20:57.991 --> 00:20:59.982
Big Bro, you're amazing!

00:21:00.126 --> 00:21:00.994
Huh?

00:21:00.994 --> 00:21:03.563
Everyone was smiling!

00:21:03.563 --> 00:21:04.464
Everyone?

00:21:04.464 --> 00:21:08.093
You're amazing! Truly amazing!

00:21:13.206 --> 00:21:15.108
Well? Have fun?

00:21:15.108 --> 00:21:17.176
Yep, it was a blast.

00:21:17.176 --> 00:21:18.278
Isn't that great?

00:21:18.278 --> 00:21:19.112
Yep!

00:21:19.112 --> 00:21:22.513
Oh, yeah. There's a surprise for you
coming in two days.

00:21:23.283 --> 00:21:24.511
What surprise?

00:21:29.489 --> 00:21:32.325
Watermelon! Where's the watermelon?!

00:21:32.325 --> 00:21:32.792
Jeez, Kanji! It's a gift, so don't devour it!

00:21:32.792 --> 00:21:34.894
Watermelon!
Jeez, Kanji! It's a gift, so don't devour it!

00:21:34.894 --> 00:21:36.162
Where is it?!
Jeez, Kanji! It's a gift, so don't devour it!

00:21:36.162 --> 00:21:37.497
My uncle's getting it now.

00:21:37.497 --> 00:21:38.064
Watermelon!
My uncle's getting it now.

00:21:38.064 --> 00:21:38.364
Watermelon!

00:21:38.364 --> 00:21:41.534
Man, I can't wait to break it open.

00:21:41.534 --> 00:21:42.835
Huh? We're breaking it open?

00:21:42.835 --> 00:21:44.564
Huh? We aren't?

00:21:45.071 --> 00:21:46.538
I wanna split it open!

00:21:46.673 --> 00:21:50.803
Splattering juice, huge smiles,
and a night of love...

00:21:51.511 --> 00:21:54.514
That bittersweet day was what youth's about!

00:21:54.514 --> 00:21:56.072
That's what youth's about!

00:21:56.349 --> 00:21:57.281
I'm back!

00:21:57.383 --> 00:22:00.819
Wow, look at all these shoes!
How many people are here?

00:22:01.421 --> 00:22:02.588
Welcome home!

00:22:02.588 --> 00:22:04.457
I wanna split it open!

00:22:04.457 --> 00:22:05.924
You do?

00:22:11.164 --> 00:22:15.362
Sorry 'bout that. I didn't even think
of breaking it open.

00:22:15.568 --> 00:22:19.005
Nanako, let's save that for later.

00:22:19.005 --> 00:22:20.306
I agree!

00:22:20.306 --> 00:22:22.604
I'd like to do that at the beach, anyway!

00:22:22.842 --> 00:22:28.109
Oh, sounds good! But I think
it'll have to wait until next year.

00:22:28.481 --> 00:22:31.084
Will you play with me again next year?

00:22:31.084 --> 00:22:32.352
Of course we will!

00:22:32.352 --> 00:22:33.284
You bet!

00:22:33.453 --> 00:22:34.385
You bet!

00:22:34.721 --> 00:22:36.518
Isn't that great, Nanako?

00:22:37.223 --> 00:22:38.087
Yep!

00:22:56.209 --> 00:23:02.170
Me to me ga aeba, jiken no hajimari
When our eyes lock, a new case starts up

00:23:02.548 --> 00:23:07.349
Sono kotoba wo bikou suru
I'll trail after those words

00:23:08.221 --> 00:23:11.691
Te to te ga furete, hora! Kyuutenkai
When our hands touch, look!

00:23:11.691 --> 00:23:13.886
Te to te ga furete, hora! Kyuutenkai
Things take a sudden turn

00:23:14.594 --> 00:23:18.997
Nazo ga mada toketeku
I'm still solving the puzzle

00:23:19.499 --> 00:23:24.737
Koi ni ochitara ne
When we fall in love

00:23:24.737 --> 00:23:31.577
Onna no ko wa minna kagisumatte ita ite ii
All girls want to sniff out all there is to know

00:23:31.577 --> 00:23:37.049
Anata no koto nara ne
We might even tell little fibs

00:23:37.049 --> 00:23:46.424
Zenbu wakachau chiisana uso de mo
That we know all about you

00:23:47.460 --> 00:23:53.330
Watashi wa Misu Raburiin; douka Go on watching
I am Miss Loveline; please go on watching

00:23:53.466 --> 00:23:55.568
Gotta love watermelons!

00:23:55.568 --> 00:23:56.728
This is bliss!

00:23:56.969 --> 00:23:58.300
Watermelons are great!

00:23:58.571 --> 00:24:00.239
Come to think of it, Big Bro...

00:24:00.239 --> 00:24:01.107
Hmm?

00:24:01.107 --> 00:24:03.776
What were you doing all summer?

00:24:03.776 --> 00:24:05.676
Want me to fill you with holes?!

00:24:07.013 --> 00:24:10.312
Yeah, well...

00:24:18.458 --> 00:24:20.526
You want me to grant their wishes?

00:24:20.526 --> 00:24:22.128
I'm going to put everyone out!

00:24:22.128 --> 00:24:24.330
Why don't the two of us go somewhere?

00:24:24.330 --> 00:24:25.231
Yu!

00:24:25.231 --> 00:24:27.700
I'm glad I met you there at the end.

00:24:27.700 --> 00:24:30.498
Damn you, Neo Featherman!
